fix: taskbar entry, cover refresh, lyric twitching

1) main window used WS_EX_TOOLWINDOW, which removes it from the taskbar and
   Alt+Tab. Switch to WS_EX_APPWINDOW; helper panels are now owned by the main
   window so they minimise/close with it.
2) cover never refreshed: play() did not clear the previous art and loadCover
   returned early on missing/failed art. Clear on every track change and on
   every failure path; sniff the bytes instead of trusting the URL suffix.
3) lyrics twitched on track change: lyrics arrive ~300ms after the click while
   the new audio is still downloading, so Position() still reported the OLD
   track clock and the highlight jumped to that spot then snapped back. Gate
   Position() on a load generation (A/B: 2.45s -> 0.00s), keep the published
   position monotonic, and let the lyric window ignore sub-500ms backwards steps.